WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:13.555
The network budget pays the fees needed for device activity. Use
this section to keep devices reporting without funding each one
by hand. Open Network budget to see the available balance and
funding controls.

2
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:26.440
Enter the amount you want to deposit. Your devices use this
budget within the spending limits you set. How often devices
report, and how much data they store, affects how quickly the
budget is used.

3
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:40.216
Review and approve the deposit in your wallet. A budget is
created if this fleet needs one. The deposit supplies funds for
activity; changing a reporting setting later does not add money
to this balance.

4
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:58.520
Once the deposit is confirmed, check the updated balance under
Keep devices reporting. Return here to monitor funds, adjust
spending limits or withdraw available funds. A confirmed deposit
means the budget is funded; device health is checked separately
on the Devices page.

